  "description": "CR 614.10a spending Brine's row lets Savor's expire with its own turn",
  "note": "Three seats: at two, each opponent and each player name the same set. bob holds Brine Elemental face down (CR 702.37) and turns it face up during alice's turn while her Savor the Moment is on the stack. Each player's tapped Goblin Piker is the observable: CR 502.3 untaps the active player's permanents, so a skipped untap step leaves it tapped. alice answers Brine's row, so Savor's survives the untap step only to end with the turn it named (CR 514.2), and nothing skips her following untap step: her Piker untaps on turn 5. This half reads lifetime: a Savor row lasting like Brine's would leave it tapped. carol's lone skip is no choice and takes exactly one untap step of hers. The pair is cr-614-10a-spending-savor-s-row-leaves-brine-s-to-take-the-following-untap-step.",
